  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Standard deviation <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>&#963;</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow></mfrac><mrow><munderover><mo stretchy=\"false\">&#8721;</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow></munderover><mrow><msubsup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msubsup></mrow></mrow><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><msup><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfrac><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mrow><munderover><mo stretchy=\"false\">&#8721;</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow></munderover><mrow><msub><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow></msub></mrow></mrow></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></msqrt></math><br /><math><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow></mfrac><mrow><munderover><mo stretchy=\"false\">&#8721;</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow></munderover><mrow><msubsup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msubsup></mrow></mrow><mo>-</mo><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mo>-</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></msqrt></math></p><p>&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>5.1</mn><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>100</mn></mfrac><mo>&#215;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><munderover><mo>&#8721;</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>n</mi></munderover><msubsup><mi>x</mi><mi>i</mi><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo>-</mo><msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mn>40</mn></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></msqrt></math><br />or, <math><mn>26.01</mn><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>100</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>&#215;</mo></math> Incorrect <math><mrow><munderover><mo stretchy=\"false\">&#8721;</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow></munderover><mrow><msubsup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msubsup></mrow></mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1600</mn></math><br />Therefore,<br />Incorrect <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><munderover><mo>&#8721;</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>n</mi></munderover><msubsup><mi>x</mi><mi>i</mi><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo>=</mo><mn>100</mn><mo>(</mo><mn>26</mn><mo>.01</mo><mo>+</mo><mn>1600</mn><mo>)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>162601</mn></math></p><p>Correct mean,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>&#160;</mo></mrow><mo>&#175;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>3990</mn><mn>100</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>39</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>9</mn></math><br />Now, Correct <math><mrow><munderover><mo stretchy=\"false\">&#8721;</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow></munderover><mrow><msubsup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msubsup></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo></math> Incorrect <math><mrow><munderover><mo stretchy=\"false\">&#8721;</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow></munderover><mrow><msubsup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msubsup></mrow></mrow><mo>-</mo><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>50</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>40</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></math><br /><math><mo>=</mo><mn>162601</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>2500</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>1600</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>161701</mn></math><br />Therefore correct standard deviation<br /><math><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mi></mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">&#8721;</mo><mrow><msubsup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msubsup></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>-</mo><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></msqrt></math><br /><math><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mfrac><mrow><mn>161701</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>100</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>-</mo><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>39.9</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></msqrt><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mn>1617.01</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>1592.01</mn></msqrt><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mn>25</mn></msqrt><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn></math></p>",
